对值≤2分，直肠出血子评分0-1分、内镜子评分0-1分）；评价时间W12中心读片内镜。","quote_sha256":"d3445fecff4405c1714bb1f070a6277c64b9c3e4efb9c75b0f2df5c90f8d3de9","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","span_id":"es6"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:revision:4","quote":"每组40例、三组共120例（3:3:3随机）；探索性精度考量；见SAP。","quote_sha256":"26140b8581d87234f4564a9c2e93340332866c6464b61ff37532491a8ae1f345","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","span_id":"es7"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es1","es2","es6","es7"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"gap_items":[],"heading":"方案概要","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为MY009212A片治疗中重度活动性溃疡性结肠炎（UC）患者的IIa期临床研究（方案编号MY009212A-IIa-01），采用多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组设计，在中国开展。研究设三个平行组：MY009212A片160mg每日两次（BID）组（候选RP2D）、MY009212A片80mg BID组（低剂量探索组）和安慰剂组，按3:3:3比例随机分配，不采用受试者内剂量递增。MY009212A片为VNN1（烟酰胺酶）抑制剂，口服片剂，规格40mg/片（以游离碱计），每日两次、每次一片、约间隔12小时给药，空腹或餐后均可；安慰剂组口服外观匹配的模拟制剂BID。目标研究人群为18至75岁（含边界）中重度活动性UC成人，改良Mayo评分5至9分、内镜子评分2至3分，对5-ASA、糖皮质激素和/或免疫抑制剂应答不佳、失应答或不耐受，且未既往使用生物制剂或小分子靶向药。研究时期包括筛选期（D-28至D-1，共4周）、双盲治疗期（D1至D84，共12周）和安全性随访期（D85至D98，共2周）。主要疗效终点为第12周临床缓解率，定义为改良Mayo评分较基线下降≥2分且绝对值≤2分，同时直肠出血子评分0至1分、内镜子评分0至1分，于W12通过中心读片内镜评价。安全性终点包括TEAE/SAE发生率及严重程度（CTCAE 5.0）、生命体征、12导联心电图、实验室检查较基线变化及育龄女性妊娠检测。计划入组120例受试者（每组40例），采用治疗策略估计目标，全分析集（FAS）为主分析集，缓解率比较采用CMH检验或logistic回归（双侧α=0.10，探索性），连续终点采用ANCOVA或MMRM，安全性在安全性分析集（SS）中描述性汇总。访视安排为筛选、基线/D1（首剂留观2小时）、W2电话、W6、W10、W12终点（含内镜）和W14安全随访，访视窗口±4天。","rationale":"设计事实（多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、3:3:3、160mg BID/80mg BID/安慰剂、12周、不采用受试者内剂量递增）、药物信息（VNN1抑制剂、40mg/片、BID）、人群（18-75岁、mMayo 5-9、内镜子2-3、初治）、研究时期（4+12+2周）、主要终点（W12临床缓解率及具体定义）、样本量（40/组共120）、统计方法（CMH/logistic、α=0.10、ANCOVA/MMRM）、估计目标（treatment policy、FAS）和访视策略均直接来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。需医学经理确认：（1）统计方法在方案正文中的呈现深度是否需与SAP完全一致或可简化引用；（2）安慰剂双盲双模拟的具体描述是否需补充；（3）安全性随访期2周是否需明确TEAE采集截止时点。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（方案概要）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（α、估计目标、计划入组）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_3f4f11edbdf4_f7d6a51fb4c06abe","section_number":"1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:1b70cc44aada7467da149483","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8906e921bf8a9f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:be5d06fd3b46ad"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261012152153_c81fc7e7","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充全球及中国UC患病率、发病率、住院率、结肠切除率等流行病学来源","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_bg_1","missing_source_classes":["流行病学文献","疾病负担报告"],"target":"疾病背景段落中UC流行病学和疾病负担数据"},{"action":"补充ECCO、ACG或中华消化病学会UC诊疗指南中关于中重度UC治疗路径和未满足需求的描述","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_bg_2","missing_source_classes":["诊疗指南"],"target":"现有治疗与指南段落"},{"action":"补充VNN1在肠道免疫和UC发病中的机制文献","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_bg_3","missing_source_classes":["机制文献"],"target":"VNN1靶点作用机制描述"}],"heading":"研究背景和立项依据","missing_source_classes":["溃疡性结肠炎流行病学数据（全球及中国患病率、发病率、疾病负担）","现行UC诊疗指南（ECCO/ACG/中华消化病学会）","VNN1靶点在UC发病机制中的机制文献","MY009212A完整非临床毒理学数据"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"疾病背景部分（UC为慢性炎症性肠病、中重度UC临床表现、现有治疗手段及未满足需求）为基于医学常识的综述性描述，缺少本批次允许来源中的流行病学数据、具体指南引用或疾病负担量化数据，需补充流行病学和指南来源后完善。MY009212A的PK/PD数据（DSS模型15mg/kg、AUC0-24约5606、人体等效剂量约80.29mg、VNN1抑制率、半衰期7-8小时）和Ib期研究数据（30例、mMayo 5-9、内镜子2-3、安全性良好、无SAE、未见量效关系）直接来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。需医学经理确认：（1）疾病背景中UC流行病学和指南引用需补充外部文献来源；（2）Ib期数据作为立项依据的引用深度是否充分；（3）VNN1靶点作用机制描述是否需补充机制文献。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_3f4f11edbdf4_2023517f090eca6e","section_number":"2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:1b70cc44aada7467da149483","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8906e921bf8a9f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:be5d06fd3b46ad"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261012152153_c81fc7e7","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充UC流行病学、诊疗指南和治疗现状来源后重新生成","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_disease_1","missing_source_classes":["流行病学文献","诊疗指南","治疗现状综述"],"target":"疾病背景及治疗现状全章"}],"heading":"疾病背景及治疗现状","missing_source_classes":["溃疡性结肠炎流行病学数据（全球及中国患病率、发病率、疾病负担）","现行UC诊疗指南（ECCO/ACG/中华消化病学会）","中重度UC治疗现状综述（含生物制剂、小分子靶向药疗效和局限性）","未满足需求文献"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章节要求撰写中重度活动性溃疡性结肠炎的疾病背景及治疗现状综述，需包含流行病学数据（患病率、发病率、疾病负担）、现行诊疗指南推荐的治疗路径、各治疗手段的疗效和局限性以及未满足需求。当前允许来源中无流行病学文献、无诊疗指南、无治疗现状综述，仅有项目章节包中","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_3f4f11edbdf4_86d0b57e2cc66119","section_number":"2.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:1b70cc44aada7467da149483","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8906e921bf8a9f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:be5d06fd3b46ad"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261012152153_c81fc7e7","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充VNN1在肠道免疫调控和UC发病中的机制文献","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_drug_1","missing_source_classes":["机制文献"],"target":"VNN1靶点作用机制完整描述"},{"action":"补充GLP毒理、安全药理、遗传毒性及毒代动力学数据","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_drug_2","missing_source_classes":["非临床毒理学报告"],"target":"非临床毒理学数据"},{"action":"补充Ib期CSR或数据摘要中各剂量组疗效终点数据","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_drug_3","missing_source_classes":["Ib期CSR"],"target":"Ib期疗效数据"},{"action":"补充药物化学结构、制剂处方、稳定性及质量标准","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_drug_4","missing_source_classes":["药学资料"],"target":"药物化学及制剂信息"}],"heading":"研究药物简介","missing_source_classes":["MY009212A完整研究者手册（IB）","VNN1靶点作用机制文献","非临床毒理学完整数据（GLP毒理、安全药理、遗传毒性）","Ib期研究完整疗效数据（CSR或数据摘要）"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"药物基本信息（VNN1抑制剂、小分子、口服片剂、40mg/片、以游离碱计、薄膜衣片、全身性系统暴露）、非临床PK/PD数据（DSS模型15mg/kg、AUC0-24约5606、人体等效剂量约80.29mg）、临床PK/PD数据（单次80mg以上24h抑制率>80%、多次160mg稳态抑制率接近100%、半衰期7-8小时、BID方向）和Ib期研究设计（30例、三个剂量组、4周、单中心开放标签、mMayo 5-9、内镜子2-3、安全性良好、无SAE、未见量效关系）均直接来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。需医学经理确认：（1）VNN1靶点作用机制的完整描述需补充机制文献和IB内容；（2）非临床毒理学数据（GLP毒理、安全药理、遗传毒性）缺失，本章节仅涵盖PK/PD摘要，需补充完整非临床档案；（3）Ib期疗效数据的具体数值（如各剂量组mMayo变化、内镜改善率）未在当前来源中给出，需补充Ib期CSR或数据摘要；（4）药物化学结构、制剂处方、稳定性等药学信息缺失。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_3f4f11edbdf4_cac6448c0ea3d569","section_number":"2.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:1b70cc44aada7467da149483","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_326dd2a3e5a7f06de283:r4:e8d978fc84842e5b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8906e921bf8a